sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant UI as React InputBar
  participant Store as Zustand session store
  participant Stream as SSE stream client
  participant Runtime as agent_runtime
  participant Agents as Swarm and tools
  participant Native as Electron native bridge
  participant Memory as MemPalace

  U->>UI: Submit message with mode
  UI->>Store: Add user message
  UI->>Store: Add empty assistant message
  UI->>Stream: POST /v1/chat/completions with mode flags
  Stream->>Runtime: Open streaming fetch
  Runtime->>Agents: Run model, tools, swarm roles
  Agents-->>Memory: Recall or store memory
  Agents-->>Native: Request filesystem, shell, PTY, or permission
  Native-->>Agents: Tool result or approval decision
  Agents-->>Runtime: Emit deltas and tool events
  Runtime-->>Stream: SSE data chunks
  Stream-->>Store: Append event
  Stream-->>Store: Accumulate assistant content
  Store-->>UI: Re-render transcript and trace
  Runtime-->>Stream: DONE or error
  Stream-->>Store: Clear streaming state
